### ==========================================
### CONFIGURACIÓN Y VARIABLES GLOBALES
### ==========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ==========================================
### PASO 0: CREAR USUARIO (Solo ejecutar una vez)
### ==========================================
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Super Admin",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "123456Password",
  "phone": "5555555555"
}

### 

# 1. PRIMERO: Haz click en "Send Request" aquí para loguearte
# (IMPORTANTE: Antes de esto, ve a MongoDB y cambia el role de este usuario a "admin")
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "admin@test.com", 
    "password": "123456Password"
}

